{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36585","headline":"长安秋夜 · 罗隐","name":"长安秋夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远闻天子似羲皇，偶舍渔乡入帝乡。\n五等列侯无故旧，一枝仙桂有风霜。\n灯欹短焰烧离鬓，漏转寒更滴旅肠。\n归计未知身已老，九衢双阙夜苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}